# Install hints for gar info (case-insensitive name match).
# Format: name|hint
Flycut|Download from https://github.com/TermiT/Flycut/releases and drag Flycut.app to /Applications
Rectangle|Download from https://rectangleapp.com and drag Rectangle.app to /Applications
Docker|Download from https://www.docker.com/products/docker-desktop/ and drag Docker.app to /Applications
qBittorrent|Download from https://www.qbittorrent.org/download; if macOS blocks it: xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine /Applications/qbittorrent.app
VS Code|Download from https://code.visualstudio.com/ and drag Visual Studio Code.app to /Applications
Cursor|Download from https://cursor.com/ and drag Cursor.app to /Applications
code|In VS Code: Cmd-Shift-P → Shell Command: Install 'code' command in PATH
cursor|In Cursor: Cmd-Shift-P → Shell Command: Install 'cursor' command in PATH
gsed|brew install gnu-sed
csvformat|brew install csvkit
gng|https://github.com/gdubw/gng — brew trust --formula gdubw/gng/gng && brew install gng
gdubw/gng|https://github.com/gdubw/gng — brew trust --formula gdubw/gng/gng && brew install gng
